meta {
  name: Inbound Traccar telemetry event-forward
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/traccar/forward
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-Traccar-Token: 
}

body:json {
{
    "device": {
        "uniqueId": "864000000000001"
    },
    "position": {},
    "event": {}
}
}

docs {
  Inbound, **shared-secret token** authenticated (no JWT). Traccar forwards position/event payloads here; the controller ingests device telemetry (online state, last position).
}
